{#
  Explainer card, solo (related content). No caption-date field on explainer, so
  the date is always the published date. 'Explainer' is a translatable interface
  string: config_translation is not enabled, so the content type label can't be
  translated.

  Matched to node--explainer--card-md.html.twig on 13 September 2026. The green
  rule under the date meets the green divider this card already draws beside the
  image. The mark is 48px in the row layout and 70px from lg, where the card
  turns into a column and has the height for it.
#}
